<title>USA: Granite Financial names president.</title>
<headline>Granite Financial names president.</headline>
<dateline>WESTMINSTER, Colo 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Granite Financial Inc said Wednesday it had named Larry White as its president and chief operating officer, effective April 28.</p>
<p>The company said the appointment allows its chairman and chief executive, William Wehner, to focus on strategic growth and financing activities.</p>
<p>Granite, which originates, funds, sells and services equipment leases, said White had been senior vice president and chief operating officer of Rockford Industries Inc of Santa Ana, California, before joining Granite.</p>
</text>
